== Preparing the Ingredients ==

Drain the @kimchi{¾%cup}(drained) and chop coarsely.

Slice the @green onions{2}.

Grate the @cheese of your choice{⅔%cup}.

== Cooking the Kimchi Quesadillas ==

Heat a drizzle of @oil{drizzle} in a #frying pan{}.

Place a @wheat or corn tortillas{4}(for a gluten-free version) in the pan and brown on one side.

Turn the tortilla over and top one half with a layer of cheese, a touch of green onion, a portion of kimchi, and another layer of cheese, to bind everything together.

Fold the tortilla in half and cook for ~{3-4%minutes}, until the cheese melts.

Gently turn over and cook for ~{3-4%minutes}, until the tortilla is golden brown.